-- title:
--   Diamond automorphisms fix the base-changed function field of X₀(N)
-- statement:
--   Let $N$ be a non-zero natural number and $c$ any natural number. Let $f$ be an element of [`ModularCurve.modularFunctionFieldFull N`](def/ModularCurve_X0.html#L305), the intermediate field of the Laurent series field $\mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,\mathbb{Q}$ over $\mathbb{Q}$ obtained by adjoining the set of $q$-expansions $\mathrm{qExpand}\,\mathbb{Q}\,d\,j_q$ for the non-zero divisors $d$ of $N$. Let $\hat f = \mathrm{coeffEmb}(\overline{\mathbb{Q}})(f)$ be the image of the underlying Laurent series under the coefficientwise ring homomorphism induced by $\mathbb{Q} \to \mathrm{AlgebraicClosure}\,\mathbb{Q}$, and assume $\hat f$ lies in [`ModularCurve.x1FunctionFieldBar N`](def/ModularCurve_X1.html#L182), that is, in `laurentBaseChange (AlgebraicClosure ℚ) (x1FunctionField N)`: the intermediate field of $\mathrm{LaurentSeries}(\overline{\mathbb{Q}})$ over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ generated by the coefficientwise image of $\mathrm{x1FunctionField}\,N = \mathrm{x1FunctionFieldC}\,\mathbb{Q}\,N$. The conclusion is that [`ModularCurve.diamondAutBar N c`](def/ModularCurve_X1Diamond.html#L94) — the automorphism `baseChangeAut (AlgebraicClosure ℚ) (diamondAut N c)`, where `diamondAut N c` is a chosen $\mathbb{Q}$-automorphism of $\mathrm{x1FunctionField}\,N$ satisfying `IsDiamondAut N c` if one exists and the identity otherwise, and `baseChangeAut` is likewise a chosen $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$-automorphism satisfying `IsBaseChangeAutOf` or the identity — sends the element $\hat f$ of `x1FunctionFieldBar N` to itself. No coprimality of $c$ with $N$ is assumed.
--
--   This is the rigidity statement that the diamond operators $\langle c\rangle$ act trivially on the functions pulled back from $X_0(N)$, formulated over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ for the Laurent-series models of the function fields of $X_1(N)$ and $X_0(N)$. It is used in the analysis of supports of Hecke and Atkin–Lehner divisors on $X_1(N)$ over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_diamondAutBar_apply_coeffEmb_modularFunctionFieldFull_eq.lean

